s","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Source-only `mori inspect` discarded errors from the profile-header reader and fell through to the Core/1 parser, losing the existing dual-profile diagnostic. Propagate that error through the existing CLI renderer before selecting the source profile.\n\nValidation: the new aggregate regression fails against the parent and passes with the repair for unknown, missing and commented UTF-8 headers. All three child outputs are captured before assertions. Two existing positive tests pass for valid Core/1 and Core/2 source consumers. The recorded candidate differs from the author test only by rustfmt argument-array wrapping; frozen diagnostic literals are unchanged. All 903 recorded after-source pins match the committed tree. Formatting was checked with edition 2024.\n\nThis draft is stacked on #248. Independent source/result review is pending. Target/native paths were unchanged and unrun; these ordinary diagnostics and positive controls establish no proof, ledger, financial or full-language acceptance.\n\n\nDelivered to `main` by #252 (merge `370e4fa598dfaea05de9da5e2b15cd436161b450`). Both changed files are byte-identical to this PR’s candidate. This stacked delivery PR is superseded; its branch and evidence history are preserved. The separate financial/help/docs work and broader product acceptance remain open.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T17:05:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:53:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T18:53:09Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8fec3bd5cdca88b5a99d14d93ca594a5fecf43f7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CharlesHoskinson:doctorwatson-language/inspect-header-errors-20261018","ref":"doctorwatson-language/inspect-header-errors-20261018","repo":{"id":1360485122,"node_id":"R_kgDOURdbAg","name":"Moriarty","full_name":"CharlesHoskinson/Moriarty","owner":{"login":"Charles